# Hual04a diagnostic route: walked canyon, real Beretta fight, corpse search attempt.
# Diagnostic weapon grant: Beretta carried from Hual01b through Hual02 (see
# hual02_route.script's campaign-loadout note). Direct Hual04a login has no Beretta.
# No teleports, set_goal or take_control. Coordinates and times are Unreal units/seconds.
# Current-runtime blocker: after BaseSoldier1 dies, XIIIPawn.Dying.Timer calls
# unsupported Actor.RecomputeBoundingVolume (#391) at bytecode 0x019D. The corpse
# suspends during its corpse timer. This fixture pins that explicit failure,
# not a completed mission; the remaining card/fuse/cable-car route is documented
# in local/reports/item66-hual04a-route.md and is not bypassed here.
t=0.50 weapon xiii.Beretta
t=1.00 switch_weapon 2
